<h2>User Guide:</h2>
<p>Step 1. Add movies to your catalog of movies on the Movie Search page. <br>
    &emsp; You can search for a movie by the title and year. You can also manually enter movie information  <br>
    &emsp; Once you find your movie hit submit.
    <br>
    <br> Step 2. Add a review to your movies.
    <br>&emsp; On the Movie Catalog page, click the details button of the movie you want to review.
    <br>&emsp; Once you are on the details page for a specific movie, click the "Edit Reivew" button. 
    <br>&emsp; Enter your movie rating and enter your written review in the fields.  
    <br>&emsp; You can edit review with the same "Edit Review" button.

</p>

    